te that the solution should contain an arbitrary function of $y:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f(x,y) & =\\int \\frac{∂f}{∂x}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\int y{e}^{xy}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={e}^{xy}+g(y)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, differentiating the above expression with respect to $y,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=x{e}^{xy}+{g}^{′}(y).\n$$\n\nTaking $\\frac{∂f}{∂y}=x{e}^{xy}+2y$ into account, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}x{e}^{xy}+{g}^{′}(y) & =x{e}^{xy}+2y \\\\ {g}^{′}(y) & =2y \\\\ g(y) & ={y}^{2}+C,\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is a constant.\n\nFinally, substituting $g(y)={y}^{2}+C$ into our expression for $f(x,y),$ we get\n\n$$\nf(x,y)={e}^{xy}+{y}^{2}+C.\n$$" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358102 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358103 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358104 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358105 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1000 #edb/ref 17592186358106 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1041 "selection" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1104 #edb/ref 17592186358103 13194139535624 true] [17592186358101 1110 #uuid "e5754676-fd25-51bd-89a3-fabf150ef837" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358102 1034 "f(x,y)=y{e}^{xy}+{x}^{2}+C" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358102 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535624 true] [17592186358102 1111 #uuid "56953072-83dd-53c5-bd82-21711aa98f61" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358103 1034 "f(x,y)={e}^{xy}+{y}^{2}+C" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358103 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535624 true] [17592186358103 1111 #uuid "ba8db0b3-97b6-51d8-b18e-4053a330473d" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358104 1034 "f(x,y)=xy{e}^{xy}+y+C" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358104 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535624 true] [17592186358104 1111 #uuid "658ec369-19b5-52ad-b51f-1b14f85d8320" 13194139535624 true] [17592186358105 1034 "f(x,y)=x{e}^{x